WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:13.000
Choose the artwork and enter a clear instruction. When using speech, check the recognized text first.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:20.000
After parsing, review the task type, dimensions, resolution and white-ink settings.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:34.000
Confirm the settings to run the task. Here, artwork width is fifteen centimeters, with five-millimeter margins on every edge.

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:39.000
Open the exported TIFF in Photoshop to inspect the result.
